"project by its accession ID. Returns complete project metadata including "
"experimental design, sample information, instruments used, data "
"processing methods, publication links, protein identifications, "
"quantification data, and file download URLs. Use accession IDs from "
"PRIDE\\_search\\_proteomics (format: PXD######)."
