"project including raw mass spectrometry files, search results, FASTA "
"databases, and supplementary data. Returns file metadata with names, "
"types, sizes, FTP/Aspera download URLs, and checksums. Essential for "
"downloading proteomics datasets for reanalysis or integration. Use "
"accession from PRIDE\\_search\\_proteomics."
