#: ../../tools/pride_tools.rst:94 662e9ab50f3c40a7ba474594416a2d83
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the PRIDE Archive for proteomics experiments and "
"mass spectrometry datasets. Returns project metadata including accession "
"IDs (PXD...), species, tissue types, instruments, publication dates, and "
"file counts. Use this to discover protein expression data, PTM studies, "
"and downloadable raw files for reanalysis. Example queries: 'breast "
"cancer', 'phosphorylation', 'COVID-19 proteome'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pride_tools.rst:98 d4e985174aab4cbda8b446b962391bce
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search keywords for proteomics experiments."
" Examples: 'cancer', 'phosphorylation', 'liver proteome', 'COVID-19'. "
"Searches across project titles, descriptions, species, and tissues."
msgstr ""

